03},{"id":"data-estimation","parentId":"statistics","name":"总体估计","sortOrder":3204},{"id":"data-regression","parentId":"statistics","name":"线性回归","sortOrder":3205},{"id":"data-independence","parentId":"statistics","name":"独立性检验","sortOrder":3206},{"id":"data-correlation","parentId":"statistics","name":"相关关系与成对数据","sortOrder":3207},{"id":"counting-principles","parentId":"counting","name":"分类与分步计数","sortOrder":3300},{"id":"permutations","parentId":"counting","name":"排列","sortOrder":3301},{"id":"combinations","parentId":"counting","name":"组合","sortOrder":3302},{"id":"counting-restrictions","parentId":"counting","name":"有限制条件的排列组合","sortOrder":3303},{"id":"binomial-theorem","parentId":"counting","name":"二项式定理","sortOrder":3304},{"id":"binomial-coefficients","parentId":"counting","name":"二项式系数与特定项","sortOrder":3305},{"id":"complex-operations","parentId":"complex","name":"复数四则运算","sortOrder":3400},{"id":"complex-plane","parentId":"complex","name":"复平面与几何意义","sortOrder":3401},{"id":"complex-modulus","parentId":"complex","name":"复数模与共轭","sortOrder":3402},{"id":"complex-equations","parentId":"complex","name":"复数与方程","sortOrder":3403}],"sources":[{"id":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","title":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","category":"上海高考","region":"上海","school":"","schoolTier":"","examType":"其他","examYear":2000,"term":"","paper":"","createdAt":"2026-09-25 07:25:06"}],"questions":[{"id":"86910c6a-9775-49c0-b12f-2e3909ee6ae2","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"21","questionType":"解答题","stemLatex":"四棱锥 $P-ABCD$ 中，底面 $ABCD$ 是一个平行四边形，$\\overrightarrow{AB}=(2,-1,-4)$，$\\overrightarrow{AD}=(4,2,0)$，$\\overrightarrow{AP}=(-1,2,-1)$。（1）求证：$PA\\perp$ 底面 $ABCD$；（2）求四棱锥 $P-ABCD$ 的体积；（3）对于向量 $\\vec a=(x_1,y_1,z_1)$、$\\vec b=(x_2,y_2,z_2)$、$\\vec c=(x_3,y_3,z_3)$，定义一种运算：$(\\vec a\\times\\vec b)\\cdot\\vec c=x_1y_2z_3+x_2y_3z_1+x_3y_1z_2-x_1y_3z_2-x_2y_1z_3-x_3y_2z_1$。试计算 $\\left|(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AD})\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AP}\\right|$ 的值；说明其与四棱锥 $P-ABCD$ 体积的关系，并猜想该运算绝对值的几何意义。","answerLatex":"PA\\perp ABCD;\\quad V=16;\\quad \\left|(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AD})\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AP}\\right|=48=3V","officialAnswer":"","officialSolution":"原书第8页：$\\overrightarrow{AP}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}=0$、$\\overrightarrow{AP}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AD}=0$，故垂直底面；体积 $V=16$；混合积绝对值为 $48$，是四棱锥体积的 $3$ 倍，可表示以三向量为棱的平行六面体的体积。","officialSource":"第8页，题21","aiSolution":"$\\overrightarrow{AP}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AB}=-2-2+4=0$，$\\overrightarrow{AP}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AD}=-4+4=0$，而 $AB,AD$ 相交且在底面，故 $PA\\perp$ 底面。$\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AD}=(8,-16,8)$，模为 $8\\sqrt6$；高 $|AP|=\\sqrt6$，故 $V=\\frac13(8\\sqrt6)(\\sqrt6)=16$。混合积为 $(8,-16,8)\\cdot(-1,2,-1)=-48$，绝对值为 $48=3V$。其几何意义是以这三个向量为相邻棱的平行六面体体积。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":4,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["solid-surface-volume","spatial-vector-operations","spatial-vector-perpendicular"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"205e48d3-d987-471d-a6e3-2086cda0971d","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"20","questionType":"解答题","stemLatex":"已知 $\\{a_n\\}$ 是等差数列，$a_1=-393$，$a_2+a_3=-768$；$\\{b_n\\}$ 是公比为 $q$（$0<q<1$）的无穷等比数列，$b_1=2$，且 $\\{b_n\\}$ 的各项和为 $20$。（1）写出 $\\{a_n\\}$ 和 $\\{b_n\\}$ 的通项公式；（2）试求满足不等式 $\\frac{a_{m+1}+a_{m+2}+\\cdots+a_{2m}}{m+1}\\le-160b_2$ 的正整数 $m$。","answerLatex":"a_n=6n-399,\\quad b_n=2\\left(\\frac9{10}\\right)^{n-1};\\quad m\\in\\{4,5,6,7,8\\}","officialAnswer":"","officialSolution":"原书第7页得公差 $d=6$，$a_n=6n-399$；公比 $q=9/10$，$b_n=2(9/10)^{n-1}$。又 $a_{m+1}+\\cdots+a_{2m}=9m^2-396m$，代入不等式得 $(m-4)(m-8)\\le0$，所以 $m=4,5,6,7,8$。","officialSource":"第7页，题20","aiSolution":"由 $a_2+a_3=2a_1+3d$ 得 $-768=-786+3d$，故 $d=6$，$a_n=6n-399$。由 $2/(1-q)=20$ 得 $q=9/10$。求和 $a_{m+1}+\\cdots+a_{2m}=m[(6(m+1)-399)+(12m-399)]/2=9m^2-396m$。又 $-160b_2=-288$，故 $9m^2-396m\\le-288(m+1)$，化简为 $(m-4)(m-8)\\le0$，正整数解为 $4,5,6,7,8$。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":3,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["arithmetic-geometric-composite","quadratic-inequality","sequence-sums"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"f8e60104-0c35-4d2c-b955-a69c2f5610c2","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"19","questionType":"解答题","stemLatex":"有一批影碟机（VCD）原销售价为每台 $800$ 元，在甲、乙两家家电商场均有销售。甲商场用如下的方法促销：买一台单价为 $780$ 元，买两台每台单价都为 $760$ 元，依次类推，每多买一台则所买各台单价均再减少 $20$ 元，但每台最低价不能低于 $440$ 元；乙商场一律都按原价的 $75\\%$ 销售。某单位需购买一批此类影碟机，问去哪家商场购买花费较少？","answerLatex":"\\begin{cases}\\text{乙商场},&1\\le x<10,\\\\\\text{两商场相同},&x=10,\\\\\\text{甲商场},&x>10,\\end{cases}\\quad x\\in\\mathbb N","officialAnswer":"","officialSolution":"原书第6至7页设购买 $x$ 台，比较甲乙差价：$1\\le x\\le18$ 时差价 $200x-20x^2$，$x>18$ 时差价 $-160x$。因此少于 $10$ 台选乙，恰好 $10$ 台两家相同，多于 $10$ 台选甲。","officialSource":"第6至7页，题19","aiSolution":"设购买 $x$ 台，甲商场单价为 $\\max(800-20x,440)$，乙商场单价为 $600$。当 $1\\le x\\le18$ 时，总价差 $C_甲-C_乙=x(200-20x)=20x(10-x)$；当 $x>18$ 时，差价为 $-160x<0$。据符号判定：$x<10$ 乙便宜，$x=10$ 相同，$x>10$ 甲便宜。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":3,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["derivative-application","function-expression","quadratic-inequality"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"f5c7a26e-0701-4c12-a32d-063398171b13","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"18","questionType":"解答题","stemLatex":"设复数 $z$ 满足 $|z|=5$，且 $(3+4i)z$ 在复平面上对应的点在第二、四象限的角平分线上，$|\\sqrt2z-m|=5\\sqrt2$（$m\\in\\mathbb R$），求 $z$ 和 $m$ 的值。","answerLatex":"(z,m)=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}+\\frac{7\\sqrt2}{2}i,0\\right),\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}+\\frac{7\\sqrt2}{2}i,2\\right),\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}-\\frac{7\\sqrt2}{2}i,0\\right),\\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}-\\frac{7\\sqrt2}{2}i,-2\\right)","officialAnswer":"","officialSolution":"原书第6页给出两种解法：设 $z=x+yi$，由角平分线条件得 $y=7x$，由 $x^2+y^2=25$ 得 $z=\\pm\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}+\\frac{7\\sqrt2}{2}i\\right)$；正号对应 $m=0,2$，负号对应 $m=0,-2$。","officialSource":"第6页，题18","aiSolution":"设 $z=x+yi$，则 $(3+4i)z=(3x-4y)+(4x+3y)i$。第二、四象限角平分线为虚部等于实部的相反数，故 $7x-y=0$。由 $x^2+y^2=25$ 得 $(x,y)=\\pm(\\sqrt2/2,7\\sqrt2/2)$。于是 $\\sqrt2z=\\pm(1+7i)$。正号时 $(1-m)^2+49=50$，$m=0$ 或 $2$；负号时 $(-1-m)^2+49=50$，$m=0$ 或 $-2$。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":3,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["complex-modulus","complex-operations","complex-plane"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"6895919a-99ac-45de-bb93-8be682f51e7f","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"16","questionType":"选择题","stemLatex":"若 $0<a<1$，$b<-1$，则函数 $f(x)=a^x+b$ 的图像不经过（　）。\\quad (A) 第一象限；(B) 第二象限；(C) 第三象限；(D) 第四象限。","answerLatex":"\\mathrm{A}","officialAnswer":"A","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"第5页“答案要点”","aiSolution":"当 $x>0$ 时 $0<a^x<1$，而 $b<-1$，所以 $f(x)<0$，图像不经过第一象限。$x<0$ 时 $a^x$ 可从 $1$ 增大到无穷，故第二、三象限均可经过；第四象限亦可经过。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":2,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["exponential-function","function-range"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"ec00d7da-a1d4-465d-b7ba-0bbfe060003c","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"15","questionType":"选择题","stemLatex":"“$a=1$”是“函数 $y=\\cos^2(ax)-\\sin^2(ax)$ 的最小正周期为 $\\pi$”的（　）。\\quad (A) 充分不必要条件；(B) 必要不充分条件；(C) 充要条件；(D) 既非充分条件也非必要条件。","answerLatex":"\\mathrm{A}","officialAnswer":"A","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"第5页“答案要点”","aiSolution":"$y=\\cos(2ax)$。当 $a\\ne0$ 时，最小正周期为 $\\pi/|a|$，故周期为 $\\pi$ 当且仅当 $a=1$ 或 $a=-1$。$a=1$ 充分但不必要。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":2,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["logic-sufficient","trig-period"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"ba3c2da1-e727-4b9d-9d30-e9a69cc39392","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"14","questionType":"选择题","stemLatex":"$x=\\sqrt{1-3y^2}$ 所表示的曲线是（　）。\\quad (A) 双曲线；(B) 椭圆；(C) 双曲线的一部分；(D) 椭圆的一部分。","answerLatex":"\\mathrm{D}","officialAnswer":"D","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"第5页“答案要点”","aiSolution":"两边平方得 $x^2+3y^2=1$，同时根号要求 $x\\ge0$，故表示椭圆的右半部分。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["ellipse-equation"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"8addc8f1-1f0e-470f-95f5-b7e6dd68bd08","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"13","questionType":"选择题","stemLatex":"抛物线 $y=-x^2$ 的焦点坐标为（　）。\\quad (A) $(0,\\frac14)$；(B) $(0,-\\frac14)$；(C) $(\\frac14,0)$；(D) $(-\\frac14,0)$。","answerLatex":"\\mathrm{B}","officialAnswer":"B","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"第5页“答案要点”","aiSolution":"写为 $x^2=-y=4py$，得 $p=-\\frac14$，焦点为 $(0,-\\frac14)$。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["parabola-equation"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"71faff07-2094-480d-8c20-dda22b339560","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"11","questionType":"填空题","stemLatex":"集合 $A=\\{(x,y)\\mid x^2+y^2=4\\}$，$B=\\{(x,y)\\mid (x-3)^2+(y-4)^2=r^2\\}$，其中 $r>0$。若 $A\\cap B$ 中有且仅有一个元素，则 $r$ 的值是 $\\underline{\\qquad}$。","answerLatex":"3\\text{ 或 }7","officialAnswer":"3或7","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"第5页“答案要点”","aiSolution":"两圆圆心距为 $5$，半径分别为 $2$ 和 $r$。只有一个交点时两圆内切或外切，因此 $5=2+r$ 或 $5=|2-r|$，且 $r>0$，解得 $r=3$ 或 $7$。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":2,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["circle-circle","set-operations"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"cfed08ac-a19e-48dc-93a1-dc4bc2e3f562","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"10","questionType":"填空题","stemLatex":"有 $n$（$n\\in\\mathbb N$）件不同的产品排成一排，若其中 $A$、$B$ 两件产品排在一起的不同排法有 $48$ 种，则 $n=\\underline{\\qquad}$。","answerLatex":"5","officialAnswer":"5","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"第5页“答案要点”","aiSolution":"将 $A,B$ 看作一组，内部有 $2$ 种排法，故 $2(n-1)!=48$，即 $(n-1)!=24=4!$，得 $n=5$。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":2,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["counting-restrictions","permutations"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"23696c55-b93e-4f06-951e-0bc171728955","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"9","questionType":"填空题","stemLatex":"若两个长方体的长、宽、高分别为 $5\\,\\mathrm{cm}$、$4\\,\\mathrm{cm}$、$3\\,\\mathrm{cm}$，把它们两个全等的面重合在一起组成大长方体，则大长方体的对角线最长为 $\\underline{\\qquad}\\,\\mathrm{cm}$。","answerLatex":"5\\sqrt5","officialAnswer":"5√5","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"第5页“答案要点”","aiSolution":"三个可能的大长方体尺寸为 $(10,4,3)$、$(5,8,3)$、$(5,4,6)$，体对角线平方依次为 $125$、$98$、$77$，最大长度为 $\\sqrt{125}=5\\sqrt5$。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":2,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["solid-surface-volume"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"fa2cbfea-0286-4d35-96db-ed464cceab4d","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"7","questionType":"填空题","stemLatex":"若数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 的通项为 $a_n=\\frac1{n(n+1)}$（$n\\in\\mathbb N$），则 $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}(a_1+n^2a_n)=\\underline{\\qquad}$。","answerLatex":"\\frac32","officialAnswer":"3/2","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"第5页“答案要点”","aiSolution":"$a_1=\\frac12$，且 $n^2a_n=\\frac{n}{n+1}\\to1$，故极限为 $\\frac32$。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["sequence-concept"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"39591718-1221-4b63-995c-51f7e7d6365e","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"6","questionType":"填空题","stemLatex":"若直线 $l$ 的倾角为 $\\pi-\\arctan\\frac12$，且过点 $(1,0)$，则直线 $l$ 的方程为 $\\underline{\\qquad}$。","answerLatex":"x+2y-1=0","officialAnswer":"x+2y-1=0","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"第5页“答案要点”","aiSolution":"斜率 $k=\\tan\\left(\\pi-\\arctan\\frac12\\right)=-\\frac12$。由点斜式 $y=-\\frac12(x-1)$，得 $x+2y-1=0$。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["line-slope-equation"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"5725cb6a-420c-4eac-a3ed-d23781110592","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"3","questionType":"填空题","stemLatex":"方程 $\\log_4(3x-1)=\\log_4(x-1)+\\log_4(3+x)$ 的解是 $\\underline{\\qquad}$。","answerLatex":"x=2","officialAnswer":"x=2","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"第5页“答案要点”","aiSolution":"定义域要求 $x>1$。由对数运算法则，$3x-1=(x-1)(x+3)$，化为 $x^2-x-2=0$，得 $x=2$ 或 $x=-1$；仅 $x=2$ 符合定义域。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":2,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["logarithm-operations","logarithmic-function"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"ed27a478-fc69-4af2-8546-df7716f9905c","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"2","questionType":"填空题","stemLatex":"若函数 $f(x)=\\frac{x}{x+2}$，则 $f^{-1}\\left(\\frac13\\right)=\\underline{\\qquad}$。","answerLatex":"1","officialAnswer":"1","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"第5页“答案要点”","aiSolution":"令 $\\frac{x}{x+2}=\\frac13$，解得 $3x=x+2$，所以 $x=1$。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["function-inverse"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]},{"id":"f8d84b9c-8c9b-4ef1-ad89-956e7b277615","sourceId":"a72493f2-8e1e-46e3-a626-e9db1029e9a5","questionYear":2000,"paperTitle":"2000年上海市普通高等学校春季招生考试数学试卷","questionNumber":"1","questionType":"填空题","stemLatex":"若 $\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\alpha\\right)=\\frac35$，则 $\\cos2\\alpha=\\underline{\\qquad}$。","answerLatex":"-\\frac7{25}","officialAnswer":"-\\frac7{25}","officialSolution":"","officialSource":"第5页“答案要点”","aiSolution":"由 $\\cos\\alpha=\\frac35$，得 $\\cos2\\alpha=2\\cos^2\\alpha-1=\\frac{18}{25}-1=-\\frac7{25}$。","assetUploadId":null,"difficulty":1,"updatedAt":"2026-09-25 07:27:48","topicIds":["trig-double-angle"],"assetUrl":null,"tikzUrls":[]}],"options":{"questionTypes":["选择题","多选题","填空题","解答题","其他"],"sourceCategories":["上海高考","全国高考","学校试卷","教辅习题","其他"],"examTypes":["春考","秋考","模拟考试","月考","期中","期末","联考","其他"],"schoolTiers":["四校","八大","其他"],"provinces":["北京","天津","河北","山西","内蒙古","辽宁","吉林","黑龙江","上海","江苏","浙江","安徽","福建","江西","山东","河南","湖北","湖南","广东","广西","海南","重庆","四川","贵州","云南","西藏","陕西","甘肃","青海","宁夏","新疆","香港","澳门","台湾"]}}